  "html": "<p>在函数调用前加一个 <code>go</code> 关键字就能并发启动一条轻量级协程，但协程之间的生命周期同步、数据交接和共享内存保护一旦没配好，程序要么提前退出漏掉结果，要么在高并发下出现难以复现的竞态崩溃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"goroutine-启动与-waitgroup-生命周期同步\">Goroutine 启动与 WaitGroup 生命周期同步</h2>\n<p>Goroutine 由 Go 运行时自主调度到操作系统线程上，初始栈空间仅几 KB，创建成千上万个协程开销极小。但要注意一条核心规则：<strong><code>main</code> 函数返回意味着整个进程立即退出，运行时不会等待任何还在跑的后台 goroutine。</strong></p>\n<p>用 <code>time.Sleep</code> 硬等后台任务既慢又不可靠，标准做法是使用 <code>sync.WaitGroup</code> 做精确计数同步：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">wg</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WaitGroup</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wg.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 放在函数开头用 defer 确保异常退出也能扣减计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\ttime.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sleep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Millisecond)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Printf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"worker </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> done</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tvar</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wg </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WaitGroup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tfor</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&lt;=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\twg.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必须在 go 语句之前调用 Add，避免 Wait 抢跑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t\tgo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&amp;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\twg.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all workers finished\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>传给 goroutine 的 <code>*sync.WaitGroup</code> 必须是指针且 <code>wg.Add(1)</code> 要写在 <code>go</code> 语句之前；按值传递 <code>WaitGroup</code> 会复制出独立的计数器，导致主协程永久阻塞死锁。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"channel-通信缓冲与关闭规则\">Channel 通信、缓冲与关闭规则</h2>\n<p>Channel 是 goroutine 之间类型安全的通信管道，默认遵循“用通信共享内存”的设计理念。创建时分无缓冲和有缓冲两种形态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>无缓冲 channel（<code>make(chan T)</code>）</strong>：发送和接收必须同步配对，先到达的一方会挂起等待另一方就绪，天然带有强同步语义。</li>\n<li><strong>有缓冲 channel（<code>make(chan T, n)</code>）</strong>：缓冲区未满时发送直接入队返回，未空时接收直接出队返回；满了或空了才挂起等待。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tch </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><s