t:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tres </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 缓冲为 1，防止超时后后台协程写通道永久泄漏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tgo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> slowRPC</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(res)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\ttimer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewTimer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Millisecond)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timer.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Stop</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tselect</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tcase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &lt;-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">res:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"response:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tcase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &lt;-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">timer.C:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"request timeout\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>超时后不再接收结果时，建议给结果 channel 留 1 个容量缓冲，否则后台任务执行完往无缓冲 channel 写入时会永远阻塞泄漏；在 <code>for-select</code> 循环里也应复用 <code>time.NewTimer</code> 并及时 <code>Stop</code>，避免每轮创建 <code>time.After</code> 堆积定时器对象。</strong></p>\n<p>如果 <code>select</code> 带了 <code>default</code> 分支，当所有通信分支都未就绪时就会立刻走 <code>default</code>，变成非阻塞探测；在循环里滥用 <code>default</code> 会导致 CPU 满载空转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据竞态互斥锁与并发安全-map\">数据竞态、互斥锁与并发安全 Map</h2>\n<p>多个 goroutine 同时读写同一块共享变量，只要其中至少有一个是写操作且没有同步保护，就会产生数据竞态（Data Race）。下面这段计数代码看似加减抵消，实际每次运行结果都可能是随机值：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tvar</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tcount </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tmu    </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Mutex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\twg    </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WaitGroup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\twg.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tgo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wg.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t\tfor</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\t\tmu.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Lock</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\t\tcount</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\t\tmu.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unlock</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tgo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wg.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t\tfor</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\t\tmu.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Lock</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\t\tcount</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\t\tmu.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unlock</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\twg.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"final count:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, count) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p>除了普通互斥锁 <code>sync.Mutex</code>，读多写少场景可用读写锁 <code>sync.RWMutex</code>（允许多个读协程并发 <code>RLock</code>，写锁 <code>Lock</code> 互斥），简单整数计数还可以直接用 <code>sync/atomic</code>（如 <code>atomic.Int64</code>）做无锁原子增减。</p>\n<p><strong>标准库 <code>map</code> 在并发读写时会直接触发 <code>fatal error: concurrent map read and map write</code> 并强制杀掉进程，这不是普通 <code>recover</code> 能兜住的异常。</strong></p>\n<p>保护并发访问映射表有两种常见方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>写法要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sync.RWMutex</code> + 普通 <code>map</code></td>\n<td>读写均衡、频繁增删改、需要复合事务操作</td>\n<td>读加 <code>RLock</code>/<code>RUnlock</code>，写加 <code>Lock</code>/<code>Unlock</code>，保持类型安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sync.Map</code></td>\n<td>读远多于写（如配置缓存），或各协程读写互不重叠的 key</td>\n<td>提供 <code>Load</code>/<code>Store</code>/<code>LoadOrStore</code>/<code>Delete</code>，键值类型为 <code>any</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>开发和测试阶段务必常开竞态检测器跑一遍 <code>go test -race ./...</code>，它能在运行期精准抓出未受保护的并发读写并定位到具体代码行。</strong></p>\n<p>理解了基本的协程调度与同步工具后，可以继续深入运行时源码层面的实现细节：<a href=\"/posts/golang-channel-internals\">Go Channel 实现原理：从环形缓冲区到协程唤醒</a> 与 <a href=\"/posts/golang-context-internals\">Go Context 实现原理：取消传播、超时控制与 Value 链</a>。</p>\n",
